#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:41
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Ninja"
msgstr "Instalação do Ninja"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:43
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When run, <command>ninja</command> normally utilizes the greatest possible "
"number of processes in parallel.  By default this is the number of cores on "
"the system, plus two.  This may overheat the CPU, or make the system run out"
" of memory.  When <command>ninja</command> is invoked from the command line,"
" passing the -jN parameter will limit the number of parallel processes. Some"
" packages embed the execution of <command>ninja</command>, and do not pass "
"the -j parameter on to it."
msgstr ""
"Quando executado, <command>ninja</command> normalmente utiliza o maior "
"número possível de processos em paralelo. Por padrão, esse é o número de "
"núcleos no sistema, mais dois. Isso possivelmente superaqueça a CPU ou faça "
"o sistema ficar sem memória. Quando <command>ninja</command> é invocado a "
"partir da linha de comando, passar o parâmetro -jN limitará o número de "
"processos paralelos. Alguns pacotes embutem a execução do "
"<command>ninja</command> e não passam o parâmetro -j para ele."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:54
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "export NINJAJOBS=4"
msgstr "export NINJAJOBS=4"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:50
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Using the <emphasis>optional</emphasis> procedure below allows a user to "
"limit the number of parallel processes via an environment variable, "
"NINJAJOBS.  <emphasis role=\"bold\">For example</emphasis>, setting: "
"<placeholder type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/> will limit <command>ninja</command> "
"to four parallel processes."
msgstr ""
"Usar o procedimento <emphasis>opcional</emphasis> abaixo permite que um(a) "
"usante limite o número de processos paralelos via uma variável de ambiente, "
"NINJAJOBS. <emphasis role=\"bold\">Por exemplo</emphasis>, configurar: "
"<placeholder type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/> limitará <command>ninja</command> a "
"quatro processos paralelos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:58
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If desired, make <command>ninja</command> recognize the environment variable"
" NINJAJOBS by running the stream editor:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, [então] faça o <command>ninja</command> reconhecer a variável "
"de ambiente NINJAJOBS executando o editor de fluxo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:61
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/int Guess/a \\\n"
"  int   j = 0;\\\n"
"  char* jobs = getenv( \"NINJAJOBS\" );\\\n"
"  if ( jobs != NULL ) j = atoi( jobs );\\\n"
"  if ( j > 0 ) return j;\\\n"
"' src/ninja.cc</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/int Guess/a \\\n"
"  int   j = 0;\\\n"
"  char* jobs = getenv( \"NINJAJOBS\" );\\\n"
"  if ( jobs != NULL ) j = atoi( jobs );\\\n"
"  if ( j > 0 ) return j;\\\n"
"' src/ninja.cc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:68
#, xml-text
msgid "Build Ninja with:"
msgstr "Construa Ninja com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:70
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">python3 configure.py --bootstrap "
"--verbose</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">python3 configure.py --bootstrap "
"--verbose</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the build option:"
msgstr "O significado da opção de construção:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:76
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--bootstrap</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--bootstrap</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "This parameter forces Ninja to rebuild itself for the current system."
msgstr ""
"Esse parâmetro força Ninja a reconstruir ele próprio para o sistema atual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--verbose</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--verbose</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:86
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This parameter makes <command>configure.py</command> show the progress "
"building Ninja."
msgstr ""
"Esse parâmetro faz com que <command>configure.py</command> mostre o "
"progresso da construção do Ninja."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The package tests cannot run in the chroot environment. They require <ulink "
"url=\"&blfs-book;general/cmake.html\">cmake</ulink>.  But the basic function"
" of this package is already tested by rebuilding itself (with the "
"<parameter>--bootstrap</parameter> option) anyway."
msgstr ""
"Os testes de pacote não podem executar no ambiente chroot. Eles exigem "
"<ulink url=\"&blfs-book;general/cmake.html\">cmake</ulink>. Mas a função "
"básica desse pacote já foi testada pela reconstrução dele mesmo (com a opção "
"<parameter>--bootstrap</parameter>) de qualquer forma."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/ninja.xml:106
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">install -vm755 ninja /usr/bin/\n"
"install -vDm644 misc/bash-completion /usr/share/bash-completion/completions/ninja\n"
"install -vDm644 misc/zsh-completion  /usr/share/zsh/site-functions/_ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">install -vm755 ninja /usr/bin/\n"
"install -vDm644 misc/bash-completion /usr/share/bash-completion/completions/ninja\n"
"install -vDm644 misc/zsh-completion  /usr/share/zsh/site-functions/_ninja</userinput>"

